# Papers, exported models and temporary artifacts stay local.
*.pdf
*.pb
*.partial
rt1/incomplete-clone-git/
rt1/robotics_transformer/trained_checkpoints/
rt1/robotics_transformer/film_efficientnet/efficientnet_checkpoints/
